{"ticker":{"symbol":"224110.KQ","name":"에이텍모빌리티","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":7100.0,"change_pct":-0.002808988764044895,"market_cap":34774081536.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.04225352112676056,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":10550.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":172,"website":"https://www.atecmobility.co.kr","business_summary":"ATEC MOBILITY Co., Ltd develops and provides products and services in the transportation card field in South Korea and internationally. The company offers bus, railway, and taxi automated fare payment solutions. It also provides autonomous driving systems; cooperative-intelligent transport systems that collect, manage, and provide traffic information; shared bicyles; a commuter bus; and encrypted driving information. In addition, the company offers integrated maintenance services for taxis, buses, trains, bicycles, kiosks, and bus computer networks; and kiosks. The company was formerly known as Atec T& Co., Ltd and changed its name to ATEC MOBILITY Co., Ltd in March 2023. ATEC MOBILITY Co., Ltd was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"ATEC MOBILITY Co., Ltd.는 한국 및 해외 교통카드 분야의 제품과 서비스를 개발하고 제공합니다. 이 회사는 버스, 철도, 택시 자동 요금 결제 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 자율주행 시스템도 제공합니다. 교통정보를 수집, 관리, 제공하는 협동지능 교통시스템; 공유 자전거; 통근버스; 그리고 암호화된 운전정보를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 택시, 버스, 기차, 자전거, 키오스크 및 버스 컴퓨터 네트워크에 대한 통합 유지 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 그리고 키오스크. 이 회사는 이전에 Atec T& Co., Ltd로 알려졌으며 2023년 3월 ATEC MOBILITY Co., Ltd로 이름을 변경했습니다. ATEC MOBILITY Co., Ltd는 1993년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"통신장비","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":150481816040.0,"operating_income":6525611750.0,"net_income":4306249380.0,"eps":828.0},{"period":